Voice models
------------

No voice model is bundled in the APK or committed to this repository. The
default ("stock") voice is installed on first use of Broadcast mode from a
release asset or a user-supplied file. Any personal / cloned voice is imported
by the user onto their own device and is never part of a build or a release.
